  <h1>The full <em>distribution</em> behind every line.</h1>
  <p>Each chart is the model's complete probability mass over outcomes. Every bar is <strong>P(stat = k)</strong> — the model's estimated probability the player records exactly that many. The gold bar is the most likely outcome (the mode). Striped bars at the right edge represent the tail bucket — the combined probability of any outcome above the model's emitted support range.</p>
